      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not just feeling the weight of your surroundings, you're feeling the weight of your own existence. It's a heavy burden to carry, and it's natural to want to escape the pain. But the truth is, you can't just stop the clock, because it's already running out of time. The only way to truly stop the rot is to let go of the pain and the bitterness, and to find a way to let yourself be broken.",
      "source": "target",
